Ethervolt supplies electricity to much of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. Over the weeks before the pilgrimage's end it began spending capital in ways that did not fit it, with a spike in the past weeks. [[Org/Belvedere|Belvedere]] put the company to [[People/Benny|Benny]] as one of two worth looking into, the other being [[Org/Alkahest Freight/index|Alkahest Freight]].
